§ `s 6 -- the immunisation requirements`

#ASSERT `the child meets the immunisation requirements` `Oliver, immunised on the schedule`
#ASSERT `the child meets the immunisation requirements` `a child with a certified contraindication`
#ASSERT `the child meets the immunisation requirements` `a child vaccinated overseas as s 6(5) requires`
#ASSERT NOT `the child meets the immunisation requirements` `a child of a parent who objects to vaccination`
#ASSERT NOT `the child meets the immunisation requirements` `an unvaccinated child with no certificate`

§ `s 61B and Sch 1 cl 7(2) -- the FTB child rate reduction`

#ASSERT NOT `the instalment FTB child rate is reduced` TRUE 63
#ASSERT `the instalment FTB child rate is reduced` TRUE 64
#ASSERT `the instalment FTB child rate is reduced` FALSE 0

#ASSERT `the days in the reduction period` TRUE 100 EQUALS 100

#ASSERT `the annual FTB child rate on a day in the reduction period` 4292.40 737.30 EQUALS 3555.10
#ASSERT `the annual FTB child rate on a day in the reduction period` 500 737.30 EQUALS 0

§ `s 85BA -- CCS eligibility`

#ASSERT `the individual is eligible for CCS for the session` `Oliver at long day care, immunised`
#ASSERT NOT `the individual is eligible for CCS for the session` `Oliver at long day care, not immunised`
#ASSERT NOT `the individual is eligible for CCS for the session` `a session in the compulsory school program`

